-\chapter{\texorpdfstring{$L$}{L}-functions modulo \texorpdfstring{$\ell^n$}{l n} and modulo \texorpdfstring{$p$}{p}}\label{III}\PrintPage{110}
-
-In this exposé, I prove a formula analogous to the main theorem of the report on
-the trace formula (this volume; cited as ``Report'' below) for a coefficient
-ring $A$ that is torsion prime to $p$, or a field of characteristic $p$.
-Essential use will be made of \PrintCite{SGA~4 XVII 5.5}{\cite[XVII 5.5]{sga4}}.
-
-\begin{center}\textbf{Contents}\end{center}
-\begin{tabular}{@{}lr@{}}
-1. Symmetric tensors & 2 \\
-2. The theorem & 7 \\
-3. Theory of \var[EN-0046]{Artin-Scheier}{Artin--Schreier}{S45-ASTRA-R-0023} & 11 \\
-4. Trace formula modulo $p$ & 16
-\end{tabular}
