-\end{equation*}
-(use the fact that the fiber at $x$ of the morphism \eqref{VI:eq:1-2-2}, for 
-$\rho=\chi^{-1}$, commutes with $F_x^\ast$, together with \eqref{VI:eq:1-5-1}). 
