-  \eR^i \pi_!\left(\sK_n((\chi_i)_{i\in I})\otimes \sF(\psi \tr_{k/\dF_q})\right) = \sK_n((\chi_i)_{i\in I}) \otimes \eR^i \pi_! \sF(\psi\tr_{k/\dF_q}) 
-\end{equation*}
-(on $V^\ast/\dG_m$). Let us compute the sheaves 
