-We argue by induction on the dimension $n$ of $X_\eta$. We may moreover
-assume---and do assume---that $X_\eta$ is dense in $X$ (replacing $X$ by
-$\bar X_\eta$ does not change the $\eR^i \Psi$, which are supported on
-$\bar X_\eta$).
